// Title: Code Execution via Pcwutl.dll
// ID: 9386d78a-7207-4048-9c9f-a93a7c2d1c05
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: Julia Fomina, oscd.community
// Date: 2020-10-05
// Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1218.011
// Description: Detects launch of executable by calling the LaunchApplication function from pcwutl.dll library.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

process where (((process.command_line like "*_pcwutl*" and process.command_line like "*_LaunchApplication*")) and ((process.executable endswith "\\rundll32.exe") or (process.pe.original_file_name == "RUNDLL32.EXE")))
